  (text "Chain: SER -> U_A -> U_B -> U_C. QA..QH of U_A drive G_A1..G_A8 (limbs L1, L2), U_B -> L3, L4, U_C -> L5, L6." (at 230 30 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 14a12c41-2ba0-4ef8-9225-4360e182da40))
  (text "Keep-alive: KA square wave (about 10 kHz) charges KY; Q holds OE_N low (outputs on). KA stops -> OE_N pulled high -> all outputs off in about 1 ms." (at 230 38 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 3c111c5b-c3cd-4b36-b176-7502dce5a99c))
  (text "JP bypasses the keep-alive for debugging only. Leave open in normal use." (at 230 42 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 42868c3b-717a-4318-ae37-72fed91d81f2))
  (text "KA must be toggled by firmware (once per scheduler frame), NOT by a free-running timer: a timer keeps toggling through a hang or a debugger halt." (at 230 46 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 154fee8a-e083-49d2-8e33-78c40b1698b5))
)
